From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:44:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8015: Add the SMC function switch
 regulators

The SMC switches some supplies through function keys on A11 phones.
Add the node that holds them, disabled until a board describes one.

Originally from iPhOmarchy patches/0040 (b2533c59a2a0), iPhOmarchy
5921728.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015.dtsi
index 58850628a..887750877 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015.dtsi
@@ -645,6 +645,11 @@ smc_hwmon: hwmon {
 				compatible = "apple,smc-hwmon";
 			};
 
+			smc_regulators: regulators {
+				compatible = "apple,smc-regulators";
+				status = "disabled";
+			};
+
 			smc_reboot: reboot {
 				compatible = "apple,t8015-smc-reboot";
 				nvmem-cells = <&shutdown_flag>, <&boot_stage>,
